type: software
title: "Je m'appelle Hương: personal academic homepage"
abstract: >-
  The personal academic homepage of Đỗ Thùy Hương, PhD candidate in Business
  Administration at Can Tho University, researching the relationship between
  internationalization and firm performance among enterprises in Asia. The site
  presents a bilingual Vietnamese–English academic profile, links the author's
  open and separately archived software projects, and disseminates research
  through an academic news blog, an interactive globe backed by World Bank Open
  Data, an illustrated virtual guide, a 3D scene and a songbook of original
  recordings. It is built entirely from plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript, with no
  build step and no server-side component, and is published as a static site.
